<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 2-yr inflation-indexed bond auction.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 2-yr inflation-indexed bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday two-year, inflation indexed bonds with three-month coupon payments after it sold 10 trln lira of similar bonds on May 1.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : May 7, 1999</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: May 6, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : May 7, 1997</p>
<p>The Treasury faces around 130 trillion lira of bond redemptions on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
